#32300
Village of Turra.~
        The village of Turra is the opening area to the Turra storyline.
The village is mainly an exp setup for low levels, 2k-15k exp range,
It links to the first room of the forest of turra at room 20.

Also if given more areas it will link with a dwarven underground city.
if readers pay attention they will notice this is also the same area
as Lands of Chaos only it is before the chaos hordes arrive. Actually
it is leading up to them arriving.~
