#32301
Approaching the village.~
        The open plains give way to a small village that is placed almost
like a gateway to the mountain range on the northern horizon. The village
has a wall stretching from east and west before turning and heading north.
A short tower is just inside the wall with a few people watching anyone
that approaches. The clouds overhead in the sky are a dark crimson color
with large thunderstorms spreadin across the sky.
~
