#32302
Approaching a village.~
   The Village is where King Turra himself was born and spent his first years
tending to his families sheep.  The village was on the verge of being abandoned
by the constant attacks from goblins and other creatures in the area when he
witnessed a light streaking across the heavens and land on the mountain.  The
mountain itself is now the ultimate prize over a very large and intense war
that has been going on for almost a hundred years now.  
~
