the mountain to see what the light was. Tur as he was known then, had always
thought there had to be something else to life other than a shepherd. The
villagers have since built a small temple on the mountaintop as a shrine
to Turra and his angel. A few sages proclaimed this shrine to possibly the
resting place of some long sought after prize that the gods once placed
on the world for any mortal to claim.
